Addition
- [N1] Added trace (model 2): init(i1) -> action(n1,"identify need for a new client") -> branch(b2,AND) -> action(n3,"analyze market") -> converge(c1) -> action(n4,"send offer to potential client") -> action(n5,"inform management about potential client responses") -> action(n6,"analyze responses") -> action(n7,"begin negotiations") -> action(n8,"detail offer according to client preferences") -> action(n9,"receive client response") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n11,"prepare contract for signing") -> action(n12,"sign contract") -> end(e1)
- [N2] Added trace (model 3): init(i1) -> action(n1,"identify need for a new client") -> branch(b2,AND) -> action(n3,"analyze market") -> converge(c1) -> action(n4,"send offer to potential client") -> action(n5,"inform management about potential client responses") -> action(n6,"analyze responses") -> action(n7,"begin negotiations") -> action(n8,"detail offer according to client preferences") -> action(n9,"receive client response") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n14,"analyze rejection and learn from experience") -> end(e2)
